# Betafly Visual Position Stabilization (Quick Notes)

Camera-only position hold for Raspberry Pi Zero / Zero 2 with CSI, USB, or analog FPV cameras plus a simple web dashboard.

## ✨ Highlights

- 🌐 **Web Interface** – http://raspberrypi.local:8080 for live charts + config
- 📷 **Camera-Only Tracking** – CSI (IMX219/OV5647), USB webcams, analog FPV via USB capture
- 🎮 **RC Integration** – SBUS/PPM/PWM stick mixing
- 🔧 **Live Config** – Tune PID, damping, and camera settings in-browser

## Quick Start

```bash
./setup.sh                               # installs deps, enables camera + UART
./betafly_stabilizer_advanced.py         # launches stabilization + web UI
# open http://raspberrypi.local:8080
```

CLI-only mode (no web UI):

```bash
./betafly_stabilizer.py --mode velocity_damping
```

