## Supported Motion Sources

| Type         | Description                               | Config value           |
|--------------|-------------------------------------------|------------------------|
| CSI Camera   | Raspberry Pi Camera Module IMX219/OV5647  | `"csi_camera"`         |
| USB Webcam   | Any UVC camera (`/dev/video*`)            | `"usb_camera"`         |
| Analog FPV   | FPV cam + USB capture dongle              | `"analog_usb"`         |
| Auto-detect  | First camera OpenCV can open              | `"opencv_any"`         |

Example `config.json` snippet:

```json
{
  "sensor": { "type": "csi_camera", "rotation": 0 },
  "camera": { "device": 0, "width": 640, "height": 480, "fps": 30 }
}
```

## Web Interface at a Glance

- Position + velocity plots
- Surface-quality meter and camera type indicator
- Mode switching (off / velocity_damping / position_hold)
- Height slider and position reset
- PID + control tuning tabs
- Camera-specific settings (resolution, FPS, device, deinterlace)
- RC stick visualization + failsafe indicator

## RC / Stick Input

```json
{
  "stick_input": {
    "enabled": true,
    "protocol": "sbus",          // sbus, ppm, pwm, mock
    "device": "/dev/ttyAMA0",
    "mix_ratio": 0.5,            // 0 = full stabilize, 1 = full manual
    "mode_channel": 4
  }
}
```

Flip a switch to change modes mid-flight once your flight controller integration is complete.
